    "make-me-an-animal":{search:"You said, \u201cCome closer,\u201d with a match in your mouth Eyes like smoke, and I drank it down I knew better, but I like the sound Of fire when it calls me out --- Every step is a slip on the wire But I chase you like a prayer on fire Losing grip, but I crave the fall Yeah, I want it all --- Make me an animal, tear me apart Dig in your claws, I\u2019ll give you my heart I don\u2019t wanna feel sane, I don\u2019t wanna be saved Just say my goddamn name Make me an animal \u2014 Make me yours, make me crawl --- Now I sleep with your ghost in my sheets You're the war that I fight just to breathe Twisted pleasure, and I wear the leash You pull, and I beg for release --- Yeah, I bite the hand that heals But you smile when I bleed I don't know what's fake or real Just know you feel, you feel-like me --- Make me an animal, tear me apart Dig in your claws, I\u2019ll give you my heart I don\u2019t wanna feel sane, I don\u2019t wanna be saved Just say my goddamn name Make me an animal \u2014 Make me yours, make me crawl --- No halo, no heaven Just skin and obsession You\u2019re the venom in the blessing And I drink it, I drink it --- Make me an animal, Show me who I am Kiss me like chaos, Break me again Make me an animal \u2014 Make me yours, make me crawl Song Lyrics: \"The Tune of a Magical Song\" I feel like I've been driven mad, Ain't the same boy my mama had. Years have crippled me, In the full-blown insanity. Live my life as a lone survivor, I quit doing the things that I love, Like drinking and getting high, And yet somehow stopped education from getting inside. I'm not the same boy, so never mind, My teenage Jekyll and Hyde way of being identified. I would not claim nor believe in government conspiracies, Most duds in my brain are due to inactivity. Exhausted need for sleep, No lack of books to read, But sorely overwhelmed, Then all my reading ceased. So I can baaaah with all the sheep, While I search to be happy. Find me somebody who has a pretty laffy taffy, And will I procreate? Lots of babies made? Ain't nothing wrong with getting along, So getting it on, plays the tune of a magical song, What a way to make all of your blues walk along. And we play the tune of a magical song, You will go or stay, but take all of your blues. Cut 'em loose, then throw them away. I feel like I've been driven mad, Ain't the same boy my mama had. Years have crippled me, In the full-blown insanity. Live my life as a lone survivor, I quit doing the things that I love, Like drinking and getting high, And yet somehow stopped education from getting inside.",snippet:"You said, \u201cCome closer,\u201d with a match in your mouth",clipIds:["f543c861-9d13-4391-93e5-e993690ec140", "19e4ae42-4462-4f9c-a011-4e73d6f0ee0f", "074e361a-e852-45e0-9952-7b0f77042bfa", "45bd6ca6-e1a1-4550-830b-e252e2faf1ff", "6743de80-4c97-4e39-8730-fb9232e28446", "1f7267a7-e3cd-443f-b9b7-da5a8b31e4e0"]},
